  "content": "[Intro]\n[B]\n[E]\n[B]\n[E]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[B]Crack my head open\n[E]on your kitchen floor\n[B]To prove to you that\n[E]I have brains\n[B]Meanwhile tin men\n[E]are led by little girls\n[B]Down golden roads that\n[E]lead to nowhere\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#m]\n[A]Fine time to\nfake a seizure\n[C#m]\nTo feel your mouth on\n[A]mine,\n[B]you're saving me\n\n[Bridge]\n[E]\n[B]\n[C#m]\n[E]\n[E]\n[B]\n[C#m]\n[E]\n\n[Pre-Verse]\n[B]\n[E]\n[B]\n[E]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[B]Whatever happened to\n[E]that silly dream you had?\n[B]I want to make it real\n[E]I'd love to rub your back\n[B]Like a plane crash\n[E]that never hits the ground\n[B]I fall in love with you\n[E]I'm nose over tail for you\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#m]\n[A]Your voice like the\nsound of sirens\n[C#m]\nto a house on\n[A]fire\n[B]You're saving me\n\n[Bridge]\n[E]\n[D#m]\n[E]\n[D#m]\n[E]\n[D#m]\n[E]\n[D#m]\n[A]\n[F#]\n[E]\n[D#m]\n[E]\n[D#m]\n[E]\n[D#m]\n[E]\n[D#m]\n[A]\n[F#]\n\n[Outro]\n[E]\n[B]\n[C#m]\n[E]\n[E]\n[B]\n[C#m]\n[E]\n[E]\n[B]\n[C#m]\n[E]\n[E]\n[B]\n[C#m]\n[A]\n[E]",
